{"text":"There's so much pressure when we are younger to define ourselves by one thing, and I disagree with that. We can and should be able to define ourselves as many things for as long as possible, especially children. Anyway, I took to answering that question spontaneously in the hope that one day I would land on a gold mine of truth by accident and finally know what my life was to be about. Entertainment lawyer, environmentalist, botanist, archaeologist, nothing really felt right. By the time I got to undergrad at Hampshire College in the US, here in Massachusetts, I was still looking for that practical, that useful, viable career path, the profitable type, the assured type. I went for the closest thing to acting that I could think of, film studies, because I figured it was better to want to hold the camera than to want to play in front of it.","words":[{"text":"There's","start":0.0,"end":0.8},{"text":"so","start":0.8,"end":0.92},{"text":"much","start":0.92,"end":1.08},{"text":"pressure","start":1.08,"end":1.62},{"text":"when","start":1.62,"end":2.0},{"text":"we","start":2.0,"end":2.18},{"text":"are","start":2.18,"end":2.24},{"text":"younger","start":2.24,"end":2.54},{"text":"to","start":2.54,"end":2.78},{"text":"define","start":2.78,"end":3.06},{"text":"ourselves","start":3.06,"end":3.46},{"text":"by","start":3.46,"end":3.72},{"text":"one","start":3.72,"end":4.0},{"text":"thing","start":4.0,"end":4.48,"punct":","},{"text":"and","start":4.98,"end":5.38},{"text":"I","start":5.38,"end":5.54},{"text":"disagree","start":5.54,"end":5.84},{"text":"with","start":5.84,"end":6.32},{"text":"that","start":6.32,"end":6.68,"punct":"."},{"text":"We","start":7.34,"end":7.62},{"text":"can","start":7.62,"end":8.2},{"text":"and","start":8.2,"end":8.46},{"text":"should","start":8.46,"end":8.72},{"text":"be","start":8.72,"end":8.9},{"text":"able","start":8.9,"end":9.12},{"text":"to","start":9.12,"end":9.28},{"text":"define","start":9.28,"end":9.62},{"text":"ourselves","start":9.62,